_text","block_id":"kCoP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bfe7884-a56e-4f15-b020-94ffc938ad08","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"関連で、「11じ10ぷんまえ」って口頭で聞いたときに、「(11時)10分前」なのか「(11時10分)前)」なのか無限に混乱する。\n(前者で解釈すると10:50、後者で解釈すると11:05くらいになる。)","ts":"1630416762.363500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TPtr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c40da9ca-d36f-4c7c-a0c0-c851faa1f1e3","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"「180度変わった」も「πrad変わった」にしよう（しない）","ts":"1630416617.363000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xj32"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6bfbc1a-7222-4369-99f2-d8661c86f417","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"EIZOは基本5年保証なので良いものを長く使いたいっていう人には向いているんですよね。最近だと液晶ディスプレイを捨てるのにも費用かかりますし。","ts":"1630416550.362600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pAhL7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d9ff299-0703-4cf6-be70-783b1d7080a3","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"lte, gte","ts":"1630416496.361700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZRUN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bfd7b74-b116-4687-bb6b-161246a91947","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"~\u0026lt;=とか\u0026lt;で記述されていれば分かりやすいのに~","ts":"1630416132.361200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U022PB40WAF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ic==a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5523e8b-36a2-4086-a55d-a0cb92df4cdd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"以下とか未満とか未だに混乱する","ts":"1630416100.360800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fNAE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9e9e34b-d922-4eff-ae55-8754ac1c3816","type":"message","user":"UQX22KG9F","text":"日本語難しい…どっちがあってるのか判らなくなる言葉がある。\nうちのFlexScan SX2462Wはちょうど10年くら